{"unit_id":"AutumnFruit-1999__dsh-macos-automation#card-zh","repo":"AutumnFruit-1999/dsh-macos-automation","commit":"19405e0b30a933c198fc3dca2f24e114c5957dfd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-macos-automation 是面向 DSH 的 macOS 桌面自动化工具插件，依赖工具注册服务并通过 bundle 接入。它注册 macos_see、macos_ocr、macos_click、macos_type、macos_hotkey、macos_scroll、macos_app、macos_window、macos_menu 和 macos_clipboard，可查看界面、识别文字、点击输入、操作应用窗口菜单及剪贴板。适合让模型通过结构化工具控制 macOS 桌面；可配置只读模式。使用前需准备 macos CLI 并授予相应系统权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:28-44","src/tools/index.ts:25-45","src/config.ts:10-21"]}
